{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "conservatory.level_check",
  "title": "Level Check",
  "status": "active",
  "entry": "start",
  "entries": [],
  "tags": [],
  "notes": "",
  "regions": [
    {
      "id": "conservatory.level_check.region",
      "title": "Level Check",
      "kind": "scene",
      "color": "#245c62",
      "nodeIds": [
        "start",
        "what",
        "levels",
        "spoils",
        "move",
        "roll"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "nodes": {
    "start": {
      "speaker": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Before anything. You never set a level in a room you have not listened to.",
          "id": "start.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "The recorder wakes up in your hand. A nifty fluorescent display, and an eleven segment meter that shows how loud your recording is.",
          "id": "start.line.2"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "what am I actually recording?",
          "goto": "what",
          "id": "start.choice.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "set the levels",
          "goto": "levels",
          "id": "start.choice.2"
        }
      ],
      "id": "start",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "what": {
      "speaker": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Room tone. Sixty seconds of a room with nothing in it.",
          "id": "what.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Not silence; there is no such thing. The air handler, the glass, the size of the place.",
          "id": "what.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "They cut it in under dialogue so a scene does not go dead between lines. Every room has one, and every one is different, and nobody has ever noticed a good one.",
          "id": "what.line.3"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "Five recordings of a building that comes down on Thursday.",
          "id": "what.line.4"
        }
      ],
      "goto": "start",
      "id": "what",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    "levels": {
      "speaker": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "The meter finds the dock. Minus fifty-four decibels. As you move, the recorder picks up your ruffling.",
          "id": "levels.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "My jacket, my knee, my breathing can all ruin this recording.",
          "id": "levels.line.2"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "so what spoils a take?",
          "goto": "spoils",
          "id": "levels.choice.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "kill the light and roll",
          "goto": "roll",
          "id": "levels.choice.2"
        }
      ],
      "id": "levels",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "spoils": {
      "speaker": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Anything I do. A step. A hand on the torch. The radio, if it ever decides to speak.",
          "id": "spoils.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Their own words: if you can hear yourself on the take, try again.",
          "id": "spoils.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "So: light off, feet still, and forty-five seconds of being furniture.",
          "id": "spoils.line.3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "and if I move?",
          "goto": "move",
          "id": "spoils.choice.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "kill the light and roll sound",
          "goto": "roll",
          "id": "spoils.choice.2"
        }
      ],
      "id": "spoils",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "move": {
      "speaker": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Then the take is spoiled and I just have to do it again. That is all. That's what I like about audio work and the arts; nobody ever dies because of a spoiled take.",
          "id": "move.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "You have done this for six years and never once said that out loud in a room.",
          "id": "move.line.2"
        }
      ],
      "goto": "levels",
      "id": "move",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    "roll": {
      "speaker": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Light off. Easier that way.",
          "id": "roll.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "That is the level. That is the room. Now you keep sixty seconds of it with nothing added.",
          "id": "roll.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "The headphones are on and the monitor is open. Press [r] to roll sound and start recording — and once you roll: do not move.",
          "id": "roll.line.3"
        }
      ],
      "id": "roll",
      "type": "dialogue"
    }
  }
}
